# AI Agent Instructions: Hensen Juang - Journey Back (`RobloxGame2`)

Build and maintain this Roblox game completely in strict Luau code (`.luau` files) using the **Rojo + Rokit** workflow. Every 3D map zone, modular prefab, obstacle, UI screen, sound controller, data store, and gameplay system must be generated programmatically in code so the entire game lives in Git and compiles into three drag-and-drop Roblox Studio packages (`Shared.rbxm`, `Server.rbxm`, `Client.rbxm`) and a full place file (`CatchAndCook` style).

Read `README.md` for the full creative vision, zones, humor, obstacles, and monetization design. Follow the technical architecture and verification rules below at all times.

---

