## 5. Verification & `.rbxm` Delivery Pipeline
Before finishing any task or pushing to GitHub, run the full check and build pipeline:
1. **Format:** `stylua src tests`
2. **Lint:** `selene src tests` (`0 errors, 0 warnings`)
3. **Unit Tests:** `luau tests/run.luau` (all tests in `tests/*.spec.luau` must pass)
4. **Typecheck:** `rojo sourcemap default.project.json -o .cache/sourcemap.json` followed by `luau-lsp analyze` (`0` errors)
5. **Build Studio Packages (`.rbxm`) & Commit to Root:**
   ```powershell
   '{"name":"Shared","tree":{"$path":"src/shared"}}' | Set-Content shared.project.json
   '{"name":"Server","tree":{"$path":"src/server"}}' | Set-Content server.project.json
   '{"name":"Client","tree":{"$path":"src/client"}}' | Set-Content client.project.json
   rojo build shared.project.json -o Shared.rbxm
   rojo build server.project.json -o Server.rbxm
   rojo build client.project.json -o Client.rbxm
   Remove-Item shared.project.json, server.project.json, client.project.json
   ```
